        <h1>Eight Sleep Review: Is It Worth It for Australians? (2026)</h1>
        <p class="description">We tested the Eight Sleep Pod Pro in Australia — here's the honest verdict on price, features, sleep tracking quality, and whether it's worth it.</p>
      </header>

      <img
        src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1559526324-4b87b5e36e44?w=1200&h=630&fit=crop&auto=format"
