            </tr>
          </tbody>
        </table>

        <p>Shipping to Australia adds to the cost — and customs/import duties can apply on electronics of this value. Eight Sleep does ship internationally, but the total landed cost for a Queen Pod Pro in Australia is realistically <strong>$4,000–$5,000 AUD</strong> depending on exchange rates and import duties.</p>

        <p>The optional subscription ( Essentials+ plan at ~$19/month or Premium at ~$29/month) unlocks historical sleep data, advanced insights, and full smart alarm functionality. Without it, you get basic tracking — but the core temperature control still works.</p>

        <h2>How It Compares to Alternatives</h2>

        <p>If you're looking at Eight Sleep, you're probably also considering other premium sleep solutions. Here's how it stacks up for Australian buyers.</p>

